Please ensure that your local `$HOME/.ssh/config` file has the following configuration. You only need to do this once,
as the content won't change with different VSCode proxy connections. 

<pre>
Host jump-server
  Hostname <%= `hostname |cut -d. -f2-` %>  User <%= `whoami` %>
Host vscode-server
  User <%= `whoami` %>  ProxyCommand ssh jump-server  "nc \$(cat ~/.vscode-host)  22"
</pre>
